This is actually a really good question because it's the difference between designing something that **looks nice** and designing something that would genuinely help a business get customers.

For a meat distributor, visitors are usually asking:

> Can I trust you?
>
> What products do you sell?
>
> Can you supply my business consistently?
>
> How do I contact you?

So I'd structure the landing page around answering those questions.

